/**
 * The Jev routing seam's closed class set and its map to OrchestKit executors.
 *
 * Nineteen intent classes shared with the hq-ext seam (same ids, same
 * descriptions, same four side judgments), so one recorded verdict reads the
 * same in both plugins. Each class maps to at most one OrchestKit executor.
 * The ops classes belong to the hq-ext front door and produce no ork nudge;
 * `continuation` and `ambiguous` never produce a nudge anywhere.
 *
 * @see https://github.com/yonatangross/orchestkit/issues/4233
 */

